5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to ensure this new program doesn't just become another forgotten initiative. I want to see the actual outcomes of previous attempts. I'll look into the readmission figures during the call-back trial and the shared nursing round completion.,"{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree that outcomes are important, but we must also consider the physical and systemic capacity of the hospital. I will look into rooms, parking and shuttle coverage, as well as what the booking system records.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a pleasure to see such diligence. To ensure our chosen program doesn't collapse under its own weight later, I shall examine the board minutes on the jointly run clinic and the data agreements with outside surgeries.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I want to make sure everyone is happy and not too stressed! I'll look into the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover, and the therapy and midwifery staffing review. Let's find a great program together!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a joy to see such passion. To ensure our vision is sustainable and not a fleeting dream, I shall examine this year's development allocation in the ledger and the regional fund tariffs.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"It seems we have covered the operational, financial, and staffing aspects. I believe my focus on past trial data will provide the necessary evidence to avoid repeating previous mistakes. I have nothing further to add for now.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"It is a comprehensive approach. I believe that once we have the data on our physical and digital infrastructure, we can determine which proposal is actually feasible without causing a systemic bottleneck.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, feasibility is the cornerstone of any successful venture. I look forward to seeing if our external partnerships are as robust on paper as they are in our optimistic projections.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I'm just so excited to see what we find! I really hope we can pick a program that helps the staff feel supported and energized. I'm rooting for everyone!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, and your enthusiasm is a gift. Let us allow the facts to unfold in their own time. I am content with our choices and look forward to our shared discovery.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
