75,3,3,talk,Yumi,,I'll skip too! I'm just so glad we found a way to help the new parents without making the other nurses too tired. This is such a happy ending!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,3,talk,Servas,,"I shall also skip. We have walked this path together with honesty and care, and we have found a solution that honors both our constraints and our calling. I am at peace.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Asuka,,I will vote for Option B. It is the only choice that avoids the failures of past initiatives and respects our current resource limitations.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Toshio,,I will vote for Option B. It is the only proposal that fits within our current capacity without risking a systemic collapse of our infrastructure.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I shall cast my vote for Option B. It is the only proposal that avoids the pitfalls of external bureaucracy and physical congestion, ensuring a stability that is far too rare in this institution.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,3,4,talk,Yumi,,I'm voting for Option B too! It's the kindest choice for our hardworking staff and a wonderful gift for the families. I'm so happy we could all agree!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
